      "note": [
        "X",
        "The land in a nature reserve can be part of privately and publicly owned property. The statistics are based on information in the Markägarkartan (Land ownership chart) and nature reserves in the Naturvårdsregistret (Environmental protection register).",
        "With 'Owner not specified in Markägarkartan' it refers to landowners who own less than 1000 hectares. Starting with the 2023 statistics, the Fortifications Administration is also included in that class. Markägarkartan is  the Swedish Environmental Protection Agencys map of forest ownership."
